  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Last night I was reading and thinking about the impacts of quantum teleportation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4420,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on teleporting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5640,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and consciousness and things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6940,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this morning CPG Grey just released a video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9780,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about teleportation and consciousness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12120,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I just couldn't resist, really really quickly writing up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15840,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a very quick response video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17240,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes I spend like, days and months working on scripts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20660,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This script I literally sat down and wrote in about 30 minutes, so it may suck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24400,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a situation where I was already thinking about this stuff so it's easy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27580,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I have a clear direction of what I'm trying to say or what I'm trying to do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30860,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of how to actually be able to write the script."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32860,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now I'm going to record it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34420,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I'll do some drawing and some other stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37040,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My good friend CG.."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37880,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My good friend CGP..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39520,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ce-cee-gee-cee-gee-cee-gee"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42420,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My good friend CPG Grey has made a great video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44420,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about the practical and philosophical concerns--"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48940,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have now finished editing the audio and I have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51620,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the storyboard all drawn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53960,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's right here: this fancy-fancy-fancy storyboard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57440,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now what I'm doing is I'm gonna do the drawings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60200,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright, so now the first drawing in this one actually isn't a drawing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63220,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the... some shots from Grey's video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66400,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so then the second drawing here is this iteration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69580,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*background voice: the concern when a transporter dismantles the atoms in your body"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72820,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and reassembles the identical arrangement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73940,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of atoms somewhere else *camera clicks continuously*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75440,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "perhaps the disassembled you actually dies, and the reassembled you is actually a new being"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79620,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that just thinks it's you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80620,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if they simply hadn't--"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82420,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*talking stop, camera clicking resumes*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85560,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One additional thing I think about when I'm drawing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87560,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is I try to draw things from left to right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90340,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that my hand reveals the picture"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99460,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright so there's one drawing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102740,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first drawing of the video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106280,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is done now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109280,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On to do the rest of the video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117560,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've finished the drawings for the video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119520,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've come back after dinner, and I going to edit it together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122340,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My drawings are actually image sequences - I take pictures"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125560,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as you could tell by the loud noise of the camera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127540,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's upside down because the camera's upside down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129960,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so what I have to do, is turn them right side up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134160,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and color-correct it and stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136200,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then it looks better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146980,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so I actually need to add in a visual effect here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149580,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For when the disassembled person dies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152140,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want a little ghostly figure to leave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154260,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is obviously not something I can do on paper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157000,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what I'm trying to do, is make this guy have kinda of little ghostly version of himself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160720,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that leaves. So I've separated out on a separate layer, just the guy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164980,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166240,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what I'm going to do is animate it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168260,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Moving over a series of frames, you know somewhere"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170920,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "somewhere up and into the sky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171720,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what that's going to do, is over time it's gonna up there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174880,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then obviously I don't want it to be that opaque,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176620,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I'll make him a little bit fainter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178480,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I'm gonna have that fade out over time as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181600,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So by somewhere like here, it's going to be around 0."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183900,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just kind of playing around with things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185260,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've got the visual effect done, so here is what it looks like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194640,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not that complicated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195860,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really like doing visual effects when they're used carefully, and tastefully"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199500,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and not just to be fancy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201240,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm at the exciting stage where I have finished"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204040,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the video, and I'm exporting it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206280,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here we go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208720,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211280,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just experienced one of the great joys of making videos,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214640,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is exporting the video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216140,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and having it export all the way\nto the very end"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218400,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and at the very last minute, \nit fails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220440,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "due to an  unknown compiler\nerror."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222880,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224000,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am trying to re-export it, and\nwe'll see what happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226880,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229660,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I'm trying to design my thumbnail, I will just look through the video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232540,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm trying to find what I think is\ngoing to look like a good thumbnail,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235100,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, normally they kind of jump out \nand are pretty obvious, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238460,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think this one..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240020,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "... with the teleportation may be \none of the more compelling ones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242920,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I ended up going with a thumbnail \nthat was a little bit more customized."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245420,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I took pieces of two of the \nteleportation ones,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248540,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and added this arrow in the\nmiddle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249920,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I also have this version of\nit that has a title."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252200,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is quantum teleportation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253640,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hopefully those are more compelling\nthumbnails,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255340,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and people will want to click on them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257340,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259940,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You may have noticed this is a bit of none usual video, and not my normal style"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263640,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I like to thank you for watching it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265340,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This video was sponsored by audible.com,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267460,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as you know audible is one of the leading provider of audio books"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270320,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they have a special offer code just for this video to see weather or not people want to watch more minutephysics behind the scenes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275860,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you go to audible.com/ behind the physics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279060,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
